{"seq":4,"slug":"partitioning","title":"分区与分片","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/database-systems/indexing-and-storage/partitioning","wordCount":763,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"分区与分片\">分区与分片</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>当单表数据量增长到千万甚至亿级时，查询性能和维护效率会显著下降。分区（Partitioning）和分片（Sharding）是解决大数据量问题的两种关键策略：分区在单机内拆分表，分片跨多机分布数据。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>概念</th>\n<th>作用域</th>\n<th>对应用透明</th>\n<th>扩展方式</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>分区</td>\n<td>单数据库内</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>垂直扩展</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>分片</td>\n<td>跨数据库</td>\n<td>通常否</td>\n<td>水平扩展</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    subgraph 分区 - 单机&#10;        T[大表] --&gt; P1[分区1]&#10;        T --&gt; P2[分区2]&#10;        T --&gt; P3[分区3]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph 分片 - 多机&#10;        A[应用] --&gt; S1[Shard 1 - 节点A]&#10;        A --&gt; S2[Shard 2 - 节点B]&#10;        A --&gt; S3[Shard 3 - 节点C]&#10;    end\">graph TD\n    subgraph 分区 - 单机\n        T[大表] --&gt; P1[分区1]\n        T --&gt; P2[分区2]\n        T --&gt; P3[分区3]\n    end\n    subgraph 分片 - 多机\n        A[应用] --&gt; S1[Shard 1 - 节点A]\n        A --&gt; S2[Shard 2 - 节点B]\n        A --&gt; S3[Shard 3 - 节点C]\n    end</pre><hr>\n<h2 id=\"水平分区与垂直分区\">水平分区与垂直分区</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>分区方式</th>\n<th>策略</th>\n<th>优点</th>\n<th>缺点</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>水平分区</td>\n<td>按行拆分到不同分区</td>\n<td>减少单分区数据量</td>\n<td>跨分区查询复杂</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>垂直分区</td>\n<td>按列拆分到不同表</td>\n<td>热点列分离</td>\n<td>需要 JOIN 还原</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"-- 垂直分区示例：将大字段分离&#10;-- 原表&#10;CREATE TABLE articles (&#10;    id BIGINT PRIMARY KEY,&#10;    title VARCHAR(200),&#10;    content TEXT,&#10;    author_id BIGINT,&#10;    created_at TIMESTAMP&#10;);&#10;&#10;-- 垂直拆分&#10;CREATE TABLE article_meta (&#10;    id BIGINT PRIMARY KEY,&#10;    title VARCHAR(200),&#10;    author_id BIGINT,&#10;    created_at TIMESTAMP&#10;);&#10;&#10;CREATE TABLE article_content (&#10;    id BIGINT PRIMARY KEY REFERENCES article_meta(id),&#10;    content TEXT&#10;);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 垂直分区示例：将大字段分离</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 原表</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> articles</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    id </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BIGINT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> PRIMARY KEY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    title </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">VARCHAR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">200</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    content </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    author_id </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BIGINT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    created_at </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TIMESTAMP</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 垂直拆分</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> article_meta</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    id </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BIGINT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> PRIMARY KEY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    title </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">VARCHAR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">200</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    author_id </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BIGINT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    created_at </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TIMESTAMP</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> article_content</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    id </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BIGINT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> PRIMARY KEY</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> REFERENCES</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> article_meta(id),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    content </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"分区类型\">分区类型</h2><h3 id=\"范围分区-range-partitioning\">范围分区（Range Partitioning）</h3><p>按连续值范围划分，最适合时间序列数据。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"-- PostgreSQL：按时间范围分区&#10;CREATE TABLE orders (&#10;    order_id    BIGSERIAL,&#10;    user_id     BIGINT NOT NULL,&#10;    total       DECIMAL(12, 2),&#10;    created_at  TIMESTAMP NOT NULL&#10;) PARTITION BY RANGE (created_at);&#10;&#10;CREATE TABLE orders_2024_q1 PARTITION OF orders&#10;    FOR VALUES FROM (&#39;2024-01-01&#39;) TO (&#39;2024-04-01&#39;);&#10;CREATE TABLE orders_2024_q2 PARTITION OF orders&#10;    FOR VALUES FROM (&#39;2024-04-01&#39;) TO (&#39;2024-07-01&#39;);&#10;CREATE TABLE orders_2024_q3 PARTITION OF orders&#10;    FOR VALUES FROM (&#39;2024-07-01&#39;) TO (&#39;2024-10-01&#39;);&#10;CREATE TABLE orders_2024_q4 PARTITION OF orders&#10;    FOR VALUES FROM (&#39;2024-10-01&#39;) TO (&#39;2025-01-01&#39;);&#10;&#10;-- 查询自动路由到对应分区&#10;SELECT * FROM orders WHERE created_at &gt;= &#39;2024-04-01&#39; AND created_at &lt; &#39;2024-07-01&#39;;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- PostgreSQL：按时间范围分区</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> orders</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    order_id    </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BIGSERIAL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    user_id     </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BIGINT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    total       </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">DECIMAL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">12</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    created_at  </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TIMESTAMP</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">PARTITION</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> BY</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> RANGE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (created_at);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> orders_2024_q1</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> PARTITION</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> OF orders</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    FOR</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> VALUES</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'2024-01-01'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TO</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'2024-04-01'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> orders_2024_q2</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> PARTITION</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> OF orders</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    FOR</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> VALUES</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'2024-04-01'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TO</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'2024-07-01'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> orders_2024_q3</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> PARTITION</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> OF orders</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    FOR</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> VALUES</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'2024-07-01'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TO</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'2024-10-01'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> orders_2024_q4</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> PARTITION</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> OF orders</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    FOR</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> VALUES</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'2024-10-01'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TO</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'2025-01-01'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 查询自动路由到对应分区</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> *</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> orders </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> created_at </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">>=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '2024-04-01'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> AND</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> created_at </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '2024-07-01'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"哈希分区-hash-partitioning\">哈希分区（Hash Partitioning）</h3><p>按哈希值均匀分布，适合数据分布不均的场景。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"-- PostgreSQL：哈希分区&#10;CREATE TABLE user_events (&#10;    event_id BIGSERIAL,&#10;    user_id  BIGINT NOT NULL,&#10;    event    VARCHAR(50),&#10;    ts       TIMESTAMP&#10;) PARTITION BY HASH (user_id);&#10;&#10;CREATE TABLE user_events_p0 PARTITION OF user_events FOR VALUES WITH (MODULUS 4, REMAINDER 0);&#10;CREATE TABLE user_events_p1 PARTITION OF user_events FOR VALUES WITH (MODULUS 4, REMAINDER 1);&#10;CREATE TABLE user_events_p2 PARTITION OF user_events FOR VALUES WITH (MODULUS 4, REMAINDER 2);&#10;CREATE TABLE user_events_p3 PARTITION OF user_events FOR VALUES WITH (MODULUS 4, REMAINDER 3);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- PostgreSQL：哈希分区</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> user_events</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    event_id </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BIGSERIAL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    user_id  </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BIGINT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    event</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    VARCHAR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">50</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    ts       </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TIMESTAMP</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">PARTITION</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> BY</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> HASH</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (user_id);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> user_events_p0</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> PARTITION</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> OF user_events </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FOR</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> VALUES</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> WITH</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (MODULUS </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">4</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, REMAINDER </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> user_events_p1</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> PARTITION</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> OF user_events </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FOR</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> VALUES</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> WITH</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (MODULUS </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">4</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, REMAINDER </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> user_events_p2</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> PARTITION</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> OF user_events </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FOR</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> VALUES</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> WITH</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (MODULUS </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">4</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, REMAINDER </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> user_events_p3</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> PARTITION</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> OF user_events </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FOR</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> VALUES</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> WITH</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (MODULUS </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">4</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, REMAINDER </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"列表分区-list-partitioning\">列表分区（List Partitioning）</h3><p>按离散值列表划分，适合枚举类型字段。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"-- PostgreSQL：列表分区&#10;CREATE TABLE customers (&#10;    id      BIGSERIAL,&#10;    name    VARCHAR(100),&#10;    region  VARCHAR(20) NOT NULL&#10;) PARTITION BY LIST (region);&#10;&#10;CREATE TABLE customers_east  PARTITION OF customers FOR VALUES IN (&#39;华东&#39;, &#39;华南&#39;);&#10;CREATE TABLE customers_west  PARTITION OF customers FOR VALUES IN (&#39;西北&#39;, &#39;西南&#39;);&#10;CREATE TABLE customers_north PARTITION OF customers FOR VALUES IN (&#39;华北&#39;, &#39;东北&#39;);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- PostgreSQL：列表分区</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> customers</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    id      </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BIGSERIAL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    name</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    VARCHAR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">100</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    region  </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">VARCHAR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">20</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">PARTITION</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> BY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> LIST (region);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> customers_east</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  PARTITION</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> OF customers </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FOR</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> VALUES</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> IN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'华东'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'华南'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> customers_west</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  PARTITION</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> OF customers </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FOR</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> VALUES</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> IN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'西北'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'西南'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> customers_north</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> PARTITION</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> OF customers </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FOR</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> VALUES</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> IN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'华北'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'东北'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"分区类型对比\">分区类型对比</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>分区类型</th>\n<th>分区键要求</th>\n<th>数据分布</th>\n<th>典型场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>范围分区</td>\n<td>连续有序值</td>\n<td>可能不均匀</td>\n<td>时间序列、日志</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>哈希分区</td>\n<td>任意类型</td>\n<td>均匀</td>\n<td>用户数据、会话</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>列表分区</td>\n<td>离散枚举值</td>\n<td>取决于数据</td>\n<td>地区、类别</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>复合分区</td>\n<td>多级分区键</td>\n<td>灵活</td>\n<td>大规模多维度数据</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"分片策略\">分片策略</h2><p>分片是将数据分布到多个数据库实例上，实现水平扩展。</p>\n<h3 id=\"分片键选择\">分片键选择</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>分片键特征</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n<th>示例</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>高基数</td>\n<td>值的种类多，分布均匀</td>\n<td>user_id</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>查询频率高</td>\n<td>大多数查询都带有该字段</td>\n<td>tenant_id</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>避免热点</td>\n<td>不会集中到少数分片</td>\n<td>避免用时间戳</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>不可变</td>\n<td>一旦确定不应修改</td>\n<td>业务 ID</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"常见分片方案\">常见分片方案</h3><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    subgraph 范围分片&#10;        R1[&quot;user_id 1~100万 → Shard 1&quot;]&#10;        R2[&quot;user_id 100万~200万 → Shard 2&quot;]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph 哈希分片&#10;        H1[&quot;user_id % 4 = 0 → Shard 1&quot;]&#10;        H2[&quot;user_id % 4 = 1 → Shard 2&quot;]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph 目录分片&#10;        D1[&quot;查找表 → user_id → Shard&quot;]&#10;    end\">graph TD\n    subgraph 范围分片\n        R1[\"user_id 1~100万 → Shard 1\"]\n        R2[\"user_id 100万~200万 → Shard 2\"]\n    end\n    subgraph 哈希分片\n        H1[\"user_id % 4 = 0 → Shard 1\"]\n        H2[\"user_id % 4 = 1 → Shard 2\"]\n    end\n    subgraph 目录分片\n        D1[\"查找表 → user_id → Shard\"]\n    end</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>方案</th>\n<th>优点</th>\n<th>缺点</th>\n<th>扩容难度</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>范围分片</td>\n<td>范围查询高效</td>\n<td>可能数据倾斜</td>\n<td>中等</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>哈希分片</td>\n<td>数据均匀分布</td>\n<td>范围查询需跨分片</td>\n<td>高</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>一致性哈希</td>\n<td>扩容只迁移少量数据</td>\n<td>实现复杂</td>\n<td>低</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>目录分片</td>\n<td>灵活分配</td>\n<td>目录成为单点</td>\n<td>低</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"分布式数据分布\">分布式数据分布</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>挑战</th>\n<th>解决方案</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>跨分片查询</td>\n<td>聚合层（中间件）或应用层合并</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>跨分片事务</td>\n<td>两阶段提交（2PC）或 Saga 模式</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>数据倾斜</td>\n<td>一致性哈希 + 虚拟节点</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>全局唯一 ID</td>\n<td>Snowflake 算法 / UUID</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>分片扩容</td>\n<td>一致性哈希或在线数据迁移工具</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"-- Snowflake ID 生成示例（PostgreSQL）&#10;CREATE SEQUENCE global_id_seq;&#10;&#10;CREATE OR REPLACE FUNCTION snowflake_id() RETURNS BIGINT AS $$&#10;DECLARE&#10;    epoch BIGINT := 1704067200000;&#10;    seq_id BIGINT;&#10;    now_ms BIGINT;&#10;    shard_id INT := 1;&#10;    result BIGINT;&#10;BEGIN&#10;    SELECT nextval(&#39;global_id_seq&#39;) % 4096 INTO seq_id;&#10;    SELECT FLOOR(EXTRACT(EPOCH FROM clock_timestamp()) * 1000) INTO now_ms;&#10;    result := (now_ms - epoch) &lt;&lt; 22;&#10;    result := result | (shard_id &lt;&lt; 12);&#10;    result := result | seq_id;&#10;    RETURN result;&#10;END;&#10;$$ LANGUAGE plpgsql;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- Snowflake ID 生成示例（PostgreSQL）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> SEQUENCE</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> global_id_seq</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE OR REPLACE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> FUNCTION</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> snowflake_id</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">RETURNS</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> BIGINT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> $$</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">DECLARE</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    epoch </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BIGINT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> :</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1704067200000</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    seq_id </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BIGINT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    now_ms </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BIGINT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    shard_id </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">INT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> :</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    result </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BIGINT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BEGIN</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> nextval(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'global_id_seq'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) % </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">4096</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> INTO</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> seq_id;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> FLOOR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(EXTRACT(EPOCH </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> clock_timestamp()) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1000</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">INTO</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> now_ms;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    result :</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (now_ms </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> epoch) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 22</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    result :</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> result | (shard_id </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 12</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    result :</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> result | seq_id;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    RETURN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> result;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">END</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">$$ </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">LANGUAGE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> plpgsql;</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"mindmap\" data-source=\"mindmap&#10;  root((分区与分片))&#10;    分区类型&#10;      范围分区 时间序列&#10;      哈希分区 均匀分布&#10;      列表分区 枚举值&#10;    分区策略&#10;      水平分区 按行&#10;      垂直分区 按列&#10;    分片&#10;      哈希分片&#10;      范围分片&#10;      一致性哈希&#10;    分布式挑战&#10;      跨分片查询&#10;      全局唯一 ID&#10;      数据倾斜\">mindmap\n  root((分区与分片))\n    分区类型\n      范围分区 时间序列\n      哈希分区 均匀分布\n      列表分区 枚举值\n    分区策略\n      水平分区 按行\n      垂直分区 按列\n    分片\n      哈希分片\n      范围分片\n      一致性哈希\n    分布式挑战\n      跨分片查询\n      全局唯一 ID\n      数据倾斜</pre><ul>\n<li><strong>分区</strong>在单机内拆分大表，对应用透明，是处理亿级数据的第一选择。</li>\n<li><strong>范围分区</strong>最适合时间序列数据，<strong>哈希分区</strong>保证数据均匀分布。</li>\n<li><strong>分片</strong>跨多个数据库实例分布数据，是水平扩展的核心手段。</li>\n<li>分片键选择至关重要：高基数、高查询频率、避免热点。</li>\n<li><strong>一致性哈希</strong>是生产环境中最常用的分片算法，扩容时只需迁移少量数据。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"分区与分片","id":"分区与分片"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"水平分区与垂直分区","id":"水平分区与垂直分区"},{"level":2,"text":"分区类型","id":"分区类型"},{"level":3,"text":"范围分区（Range Partitioning）","id":"范围分区-range-partitioning"},{"level":3,"text":"哈希分区（Hash Partitioning）","id":"哈希分区-hash-partitioning"},{"level":3,"text":"列表分区（List Partitioning）","id":"列表分区-list-partitioning"},{"level":3,"text":"分区类型对比","id":"分区类型对比"},{"level":2,"text":"分片策略","id":"分片策略"},{"level":3,"text":"分片键选择","id":"分片键选择"},{"level":3,"text":"常见分片方案","id":"常见分片方案"},{"level":2,"text":"分布式数据分布","id":"分布式数据分布"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"存储引擎","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/database-systems/indexing-and-storage/storage-engines"},"next":{"title":"ACID 特性","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/database-systems/transactions-and-concurrency/acid-properties"}}